  "title": "Easy Chocolate Shortbread Cookies",
  "description": "These simple shortbread cookies have a deep chocolate flavor and are easy to bake in a baking pan, with no rolling out or cookie cutters required.",
  "authors": [
    "NICOSMOMDEE"
  ],
